    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0183" n="109" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg109"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5533a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-25T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 25, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5043. Please tell Mr. Balfour that Mr. Morgenthau sailed June 21 on steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Buenos Aires</hi> and should arrive in Cádiz about July
                    1. Also say that I will be very grateful if he can arrange to have Mr. Chaim
                    Weizmann meet Mr. Morgenthau at Gibraltar. I hope you will leave nothing undone
                    to secure Mr. Balfour’s consent, as it is considered most important that Mr.
                    Morgenthau see Mr. Weizmann.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
